{"seq":9,"slug":"deng-foreign-policy","title":"邓小平外交思想","stage":"DONE","category":"deng-xiaoping-theory","categoryLabel":"邓小平理论","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-foreign-policy","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/02_deng-xiaoping-theory/09_deng-foreign-policy","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"邓小平外交思想-简介\">邓小平外交思想 简介</h1><p>本 hub 聚焦邓小平理论在<strong>国际关系与对外战略</strong>领域的展开：时代主题的重新判断（&quot;和平与发展&quot;）、对外战略方针（&quot;韬光养晦、有所作为&quot;）、独立自主的和平外交路线，以及它们在中美、中日、第三世界等具体外交实践中的落地与长期遗产。一句话定位——<strong>邓小平如何重新判断世界、并据此重排中国的对外关系优先级，为改革开放赢得和平国际环境</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>邓小平理论被拆为十个 hub，本 hub 只管&quot;对外/国际&quot;这一面。容易混淆的边界如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关注问题</th>\n<th>去这个 hub</th>\n<th>而非本 hub</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>改革开放的对内决策、经济体制</td>\n<td>03 改革开放、07 社会主义市场经济理论</td>\n<td>本 hub 只讲&quot;对外开放&quot;的外交侧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引进外资/技术的国内政策机制</td>\n<td>03 改革开放·开放政策</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲对美对日外交如何打通通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>港澳台与主权的制度设计</td>\n<td>06 一国两制</td>\n<td>本 hub 只讲不干涉内政的外交原则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邓小平思想方法论（实事求是、猫论）</td>\n<td>08 方法论、01 思想概述</td>\n<td>本 hub 是方法论在外交上的应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>思想的总体定位与历史评价</td>\n<td>01 思想概述、10 邓小平遗产</td>\n<td>本 hub 限于外交遗产</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：<strong>对内看 03/07/06，方法论看 01/08，对外战略与外交实践看本 hub。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>本 hub 三章按&quot;判断 → 实践 → 遗产&quot;递进，建议顺序阅读：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>第一章 战略判断</strong> —— 先建立分析框架：和平与发展时代判断、韬光养晦战略、独立自主的和平外交政策。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 外交实践</strong> —— 看框架如何落地：中美关系正常化、中日邦交、第三世界团结。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 遗产影响</strong> —— 评估长期效应：和平发展道路、不干涉内政原则、多边外交。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>分人群建议：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>初学者/通识读者</strong>：按 1→2→3 顺序通读，重点抓每篇&quot;核心概念&quot;与&quot;小结&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>国际关系学习者</strong>：可先读第一章，再横向对照 <a href=\"../../../political-science/international-relations/ir-theories/realism\">22 政治学·国际关系理论</a> 中的现实主义/自由主义，把经验判断映射到理论框架。</li>\n<li><strong>关注当代中国外交者</strong>：从第三章倒读，结合 <a href=\"../../../geography-geopolitics/geopolitics/contemporary-geopolitics/us-china-competition\">39 地缘政治·中美战略竞争</a> 与 <a href=\"../../../geography-geopolitics/geopolitics/contemporary-geopolitics/belt-and-road\">一带一路</a> 理解韬光养晦遗产的当代演变。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>阅读本 hub 几乎无硬性门槛，但具备以下背景会理解更深：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>冷战格局基本常识</strong>：美苏两极、核均势、社会主义阵营兴衰——决定了邓小平判断的历史坐标。</li>\n<li><strong>新中国前期外交脉络</strong>：&quot;一边倒&quot;&quot;两条线&quot;&quot;一条线&quot;的演变（见第一章·独立自主政策篇会简要回顾）。</li>\n<li><strong>改革开放的对内逻辑</strong>：外交转向的根本动因是为经济建设服务，建议先了解 <a href=\"../reform-and-opening-up/decision-background/third-plenum-turning-point\">03 改革开放</a> 的决策背景。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>不熟悉国际关系理论术语（现实主义、不结盟、多边主义）的读者，可在阅读中随时跳转到各篇末尾&quot;延伸阅读与跨学科链接&quot;补足。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"strategic-judgment","title":"战略判断","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-foreign-policy/strategic-judgment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"peace-development-era","title":"和平与发展的时代判断","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-foreign-policy/strategic-judgment/peace-development-era"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hide-strength-bide-time","title":"韬光养晦战略","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-foreign-policy/strategic-judgment/hide-strength-bide-time"},{"seq":3,"slug":"independent-foreign-policy","title":"独立自主的和平外交政策","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-foreign-policy/strategic-judgment/independent-foreign-policy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"diplomatic-practice","title":"外交实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-foreign-policy/diplomatic-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sino-us-normalization","title":"中美关系正常化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-foreign-policy/diplomatic-practice/sino-us-normalization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sino-japan-relations","title":"中日关系与邦交正常化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-foreign-policy/diplomatic-practice/sino-japan-relations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"third-world-solidarity","title":"第三世界团结与南南合作","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-foreign-policy/diplomatic-practice/third-world-solidarity"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"legacy-influence","title":"遗产影响","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-foreign-policy/legacy-influence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"peaceful-development-path","title":"和平发展道路的理论奠基","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-foreign-policy/legacy-influence/peaceful-development-path"},{"seq":2,"slug":"non-interference-principle","title":"不干涉内政原则的实践与演变","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-foreign-policy/legacy-influence/non-interference-principle"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multilateral-diplomacy","title":"多边外交与国际体系参与","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-foreign-policy/legacy-influence/multilateral-diplomacy"}]}]}